 It's labelled as Daniel's contacts."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":355},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-03-15"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: I already told you about it."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":356},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-03-16"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Right."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":357},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-03-17"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: And the number didn't have a name."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":358},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-03-18"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: We know."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":359},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-03-19"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: I'm getting there."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":360},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-03-20"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: There was something beside it."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":361},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-03-21"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: A star next to the number."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":362},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-03-22"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: A favourite contact?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":363},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-03-23"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Maybe. I don't know how that export uses it."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":364},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-03-24"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: It just says starred. There's no saved name or label."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":365},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-03-25"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Do we even know Daniel was the one who marked it?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":366},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-03-26"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: 