her."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":386},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-04-28"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Someone has to."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":387},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-04-30"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: I ate."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":388},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-04-31"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Congratulations, Lucas."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":389},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-04-32"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: You asked."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":390},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-04-33"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: I did."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":391},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-04-34"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: 😂"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":392},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-04-35"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: There. See?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":393},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-04-36"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: She still remembers how to laugh."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":394},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-04-37"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Barely."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":395},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-04-39"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: It isn't funny."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":396},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-04-40"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Nobody said the situation was funny."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":397},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-04-41"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Then can we stay focused?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":398},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-04-42"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: We can be worried and still act 