own"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"They'd probably get parts of it wrong."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586294667}}],"id":3171},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U03-COMMON-5"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Daniel left behind something like that."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586297777}}],"id":3172},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U03-COMMON-6"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Not his actual phone."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586298867}}],"id":3173},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U03-COMMON-7"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"A mirror. An incomplete copy of certain records."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586300397}}],"id":3174},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U03-COMMON-8"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Some older than others. Some possibly changed."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586301817}}],"id":3175},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-PLAYER-U04_C"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"player"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Prove it."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586371325}}],"id":3176},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U04_C-0"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"A good demand."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586372305}}],"id":3177},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U04-NO-0"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"I could send you a screenshot. I could also have made it."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586374275}}],"id":3178},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U04-NO-1"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"If you inspect the copy, you'll see what it contains. That still won't prove where it came from."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586376905}}],"id":3179},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U04-COMMON-0"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"The point isn't that I can hand you the truth."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586378655}}],"id":3180},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U04-COMMON-1"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"It's that you could compare what people remember with what was written down."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586380735}}],"id":3181},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U04-COMMON-2"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Daniel didn't keep everything in one place."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586382155}}],"id":3182},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U04-COMMON-3"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"The records he was worried about weren't all in one place either."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586384125}}],"id":3183},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U04-COMMON-4"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"This mirror won't give you an answer by itself."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586385765}}],"id":3184},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U04-COMMON-5"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"But it may give you better questions."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586387185}}],"id":3185},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U04-COMMON-6"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"I can give you access."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586388385}}],"id":3186},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-PLAYER-U05_C"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"player"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"What do you want in return?"}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586461422}}],"id":3187},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U05_C-0"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Right now? Nothing you can send me."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586462842}}],"id":3188},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U05_C-1"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Later, you might find something I want to know."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586464482}}],"id":3189},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U05_C-2"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Don't promise me anything. Especially not before you see it."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586466232}}],"id":3190},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U05-COMMON-0"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"One warning before you decide."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586467432}}],"id":3191},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U05-COMMON-1"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Some of what you'll see was never meant for you."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586469182}}],"id":3192},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U05-COMMON-2"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Old arguments. Unsent messages. Things Daniel may have regretted writing."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586470932}}],"id":3193},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U05-COMMON-3"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"And fragments that might make innocent people look guilty when they're taken out of context."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586473232}}],"id":3194},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U05-COMMON-4"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"You decide what to open. You decide what to share."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586474982}}],"id":3195},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-PLAYER-U06_A"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"player"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"That sounds like a serious invasion of privacy."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586551543}}],"id":3196},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U06_A-0"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"It is."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586552443}}],"id":3197},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U06_A-1"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"I'm not going to pretend otherwise."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586553753}}],"id":3198},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U06_A-2"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"If you open it, be prepared to question your own reasons, too."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586555723}}],"id":3199},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U06-COMMON-0"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"There's something else you need to understand."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586557143}}],"id":3200},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U06-COMMON-1"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"A copy can be incomplete. It can also be arranged to mislead you."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586559223}}],"id":3201},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-PLAYER-U06B_A"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"player"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"How do I know you're not manipulating what I see?"}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586641656}}],"id":3202},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U06B_A-0"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"You don't."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586642556}}],"id":3203},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U06B_A-1"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Check dates and context. Compare things from different sources."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586644196}}],"id":3204},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U06B-COMMON-0"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"And when two copies disagree, don't automatically trust the newer one."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586646056}}],"id":3205},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U06B-COMMON-1"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"The Archive is already installed on your device."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586650086}}],"id":3206},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U06B-COMMON-2"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"It was never fully activated."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586651286}}],"id":3207},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U06B-COMMON-3"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"I can send the missing access package."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586652706}}],"id":3208},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U06B-COMMON-4"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"After that, it's your decision what to do with it."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586654456}}],"id":3209},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-PLAYER-U07Q_C"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"player"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"What exactly will change on my phone?"}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586821943}}],"id":3210},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U07Q_C-0"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"The Archive gains a device mirror."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586823253}}],"id":3211},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U07Q_C-1"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Messages gets a passive relay component. It won't have anything to display until a relay is available."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586825773}}],"id":3212},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-PLAYER-DECLINE"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"player"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"No. I'm not opening an unverified package."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586912105}}],"id":3213},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-DECLINE-0"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"That's a reasonable decision."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586913195}}],"id":3214},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-DECLINE-1"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"I'm leaving the package in this thread. You can inspect it again later."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586915275}}],"id":3215},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-DECLINE-2"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"I won't install it for you."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792586916585}}],"id":3216},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-PLAYER-ACCEPT"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"player"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Fine. I'll open it."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792587010706}}],"id":3217},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-ACCEPT-0"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"You don't sound convinced."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792587011796}}],"id":3218},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-PLAYER-U07_ACK_C"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"player"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"Don't mistake this for trust."}},{"k":"at","v":{"n":1792587100873}}],"id":3219},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"C2-UNKNOWN-U07_ACK_C-0"}},{"k":"sender","v":{"s":"unknown"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"I won't."}},{